sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Ali as Ali (web app)
  participant API as API
  participant Q as Job queue (Postgres)
  participant RUN as Worker: run engine
  participant LLM as Model
  participant GM as Gmail plugin
  participant DB as Postgres
  Ali->>API: Send "@Inbox reply to Vicky"
  API->>DB: save message + run + job (one transaction)
  Q->>RUN: job "advance run" (lock: this chat)
  RUN->>LLM: instructions + history + tools
  LLM-->>RUN: tool call gmail_send_email(...)
  RUN->>RUN: policy: Ask before acting × send = ASK
  RUN->>DB: save approval request + checkpoint
  RUN-->>Q: job done (run is waiting_approval)
  DB-->>Ali: event, live update: approval card
  Note over Q,DB: The run is asleep: no worker, no compute.<br/>It survives restarts and deploys.
  Ali->>API: Approve (with an edited body)
  API->>DB: pending to approved, only if still pending<br/>(who, when, final args hash) + resume job
  Q->>RUN: job "resume run" (same lock)
  RUN->>DB: tool execution: started (unique per tool call)
  RUN->>GM: send_email(final args)
  GM-->>RUN: sent, message id
  RUN->>DB: tool execution: succeeded + audit log
  RUN->>LLM: tool result
  LLM-->>RUN: "Sent. I told Vicky we can't do Q3."
  DB-->>Ali: event, live update: reply + Done card
